// 289's music/scripts/musicplayer.rs2 on 2011's music player (music_v3, 187).
//
// 289's tab is a button per track, with Auto, Manual and Loop. 2011's lists
// its tracks as com1's children, built by clientscript 828: a track's name at
// its index * 2 (enum 1345's order) and its playlist button at index * 2 + 1.
// Play is the name's op1, offered on an unlocked track (clientscript 3681),
// and the client keeps it from a locked one, which offers only Unlock hint
// (op2, clientscript 3680).
//
// Left out:
// - 289's Auto, Manual and Loop: 2011's player has no such buttons, and a
//   song plays to its end before the area's follows (music.rs2).
// - 2011's playlist (com9-13; 2011 wiki, Music playlist, 8 February 2010)
//   and search (com16): 289 has neither, so their ops are not offered
//   (login.rs2) and their buttons do nothing.

[if_button1,music_v3:com_1] @music_playbybutton(divide(last_slot, 2));

// Unlock hint: the client says where the track unlocks (clientscript 833,
// enums 1349 and 952) and asks nothing of the server.
[if_button2,music_v3:com_1]
